{
  "source": "course-assets/work-with-ai-opener/work-with-ai-opener.mp4",
  "duration": 136.5333125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.76,
      "text": "Take a look at these four principles."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.42,
      "end": 5.36,
      "text": "High-quality AI results require a change in approach."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.96,
      "end": 8.3,
      "text": "You aim your requests, you verify the output,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.76,
      "end": 10.0,
      "text": "and you treat it as a collaboration."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.0,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "The final line captures the central goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.6,
      "end": 15.04,
      "text": "Your logic provides the foundation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.48,
      "end": 17.58,
      "text": "which AI scales up and amplifies."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.92,
      "end": 20.28,
      "text": "You've seen the tools capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.24,
      "end": 25.1,
      "text": "Now we shift our focus to the practical mechanics of how you actually operate it."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.18,
      "end": 28.32,
      "text": "Here is the reality most people miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.32,
      "end": 31.36,
      "text": "Two people can use the exact same AI system"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.36,
      "end": 33.74,
      "text": "and walk away with completely different outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.4,
      "end": 35.12,
      "text": "Think of it like photography."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.08,
      "end": 38.4,
      "text": "Imagine two people holding identical phone cameras,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.7,
      "end": 40.54,
      "text": "pointing them at the exact same sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.14,
      "end": 43.26,
      "text": "One person snaps a rushed blurry picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.76,
      "end": 46.52,
      "text": "The other person captures a carefully framed crisp shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.14,
      "end": 48.74,
      "text": "The hardware in their hands never changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.48,
      "end": 51.22,
      "text": "The same principle applies to AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.36,
      "end": 53.7,
      "text": "Mastering the mechanics of the tool"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.7,
      "end": 57.6,
      "text": "is what turns a confusing response into a sharp, professional result."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.12,
      "end": 62.14,
      "text": "To build those mechanics, we use a three-part road map."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.7,
      "end": 64.26,
      "text": "Let's look at the plan for this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 66.88,
      "text": "Step one is knowing what it's for."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.46,
      "end": 70.28,
      "text": "This involves understanding how AI operates differently"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.28,
      "end": 74.22,
      "text": "from traditional software that follows a strict, predictable set of rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.84,
      "end": 78.02,
      "text": "You need to identify the specific types of work and logic"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.02,
      "end": 80.3,
      "text": "that these models are naturally built to handle."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.78,
      "end": 84.02,
      "text": "From there, you choose the correct application for your specific task"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.02,
      "end": 87.06,
      "text": "and commit to learning how its specific interface works."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.94,
      "end": 89.24,
      "text": "Second, use it well."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.98,
      "end": 92.42,
      "text": "We will practice giving the model specific details"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.42,
      "end": 94.48,
      "text": "to steer it toward a better answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.48,
      "end": 97.06,
      "text": "and look at how the software actually reads your prompts."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.76,
      "end": 100.08,
      "text": "Third, think before you trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.7,
      "end": 103.64,
      "text": "This is the crucial final phase of handling the model's output."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.14,
      "end": 108.06,
      "text": "Because models generate plausible but sometimes incorrect information,"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.06,
      "end": 111.36,
      "text": "you must actively verify claims against credible sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.1,
      "end": 113.66,
      "text": "The software proposes an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.34,
      "end": 118.12,
      "text": "You remain the final judge of whether that work is accurate and ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.16,
      "end": 121.68,
      "text": "The quality of your final result depends directly"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.68,
      "end": 124.32,
      "text": "on how deliberately you apply these three steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.88,
      "end": 128.34,
      "text": "Don't just use AI. Work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.28,
      "end": 132.28,
      "text": "AI doesn't replace your thinking. It multiplies it."
    }
  ],
